SUMMARY:Susannah Israel: Procession
DESCRIPTION:The John Natsoulas Gallery is thrilled to announce the exhibition of Susannah Israel’s distinctive ceramics. Her individualized figures each possess an openness of expression\, inviting close contemplation and investigation into their stories. \nTo be exhibited on the second floor of the gallery\, her body of work is a reflection of the humor she uses to confront the struggles of life. Her emphasis of gesture takes an equal role to her interest in abstraction and distortion. The dynamic figures\, some in conversation with a paired piece\, offer viewers discrete narratives to consider\, even as the overarching themes remain cohesive. The wide date-range present in this exhibition provides insight into her developments. Her repetitious use of unglazed terracotta-colored clay reminds viewers of the earthen and historical origins of her medium. The warmth and rich coloration of each figure shines\, even when the figure is subsumed entirely with glazes and surface designs. \nOriginally from New York\, the artist studied ceramics for some time at Pratt Art Institute with Byron Temple\, and she later earned both a BA and an MFA from San Francisco State University. Her extensive teaching at numerous institutions in California took her to schools across the state. Her work has been exhibited throughout the world\, and her sculpture is found in museums\, private art collections\, and public art sites throughout the United States. Her career distinctions include the Fletcher Challenge Premier Award\, a Virginia Groot Foundation Award\, and residencies at the Archie Bray and the Doelger Art Center. Her extensive output of writing primarily showcases and uplifts talented artists who are typically excluded from galleries and museums. \nThe exhibition’s opening reception will be held on Friday August 21\, from 7 to 9 PM. It will feature live music and refreshments.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/susannah-israel-procession/
LOCATION:John Natsoulas Gallery\, 521 1st St\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-13-at-6.40.08-PM.png
ORGANIZER;CN="John Natsoulas Gallery":MAILTO:art@natsoulas.com
GEO:38.5422315;-121.7409632
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=John Natsoulas Gallery 521 1st St Davis CA 95616 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=521 1st St:geo:-121.7409632,38.5422315
END:VEVENT
