SUMMARY:Cruisin' into the Next Chapter Classic Car & Truck Show
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 9th annual Cruisin’ into the Next Chapter Classic Car & Truck Show in the town of Yolo on Saturday\, August 22\, 2026 from 10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m. benefiting the Yolo Branch Library. This fun filled family day will feature an array of over 100 classic cars and trucks\, antique fire engines\, tractors and gas engines\, delicious food\, a large raffle\, event and Yolo T-shirts\, free balloon creations and books for children\, a variety of vendors\, an expanded lowrider bike show open to all ages\, and new this year – the very popular TrackLab high-speed mini 4WD model car racing set up on the library lawn – free for all to enjoy.
