SUMMARY:Dirty Cello Live
DESCRIPTION:Join the Dirty Cello band for a special night at the Fair Oaks Performing Arts Center on Aug 22. \nThe Dirty Cello band has a crazy backstory and a lot of wild adventures. After spending years studying for the classical symphony world\, things went off the rails\, and now they travel the world playing blues and rock. The Dirty Cello band features classical cellist gone rogue\, Rebecca Roudman on cello and vocals\, who is backed up by a top notch rhythm section. \nA review from Aldora Magazine\, a UK based publication\, recently described them as\, “Their combination of blues\, rock and roll\, and bluegrass is an utterly irresistible sonic cocktail\, converting listeners in their droves\, a fanbase that now has dedicated cult followings all around the world.” \nDirty Cello at Fair Oaks Performing Arts Center\n7991 California Ave\, Fair Oaks\, CA 95628\nAug 22 at 7:30 pm\nTickets: $20 – $24 at https://www.fairoaksarts.org/
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/dirty-cello-live/
LOCATION:Fair Oaks Performing Arts Center\, 7991 California Ave\, Fair Oaks\, CA\, 95628\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dirty-Cello-promo-2-by-Frederic-Aube-scaled.jpg
